      <h1>How Players Qualify for the World Darts Championship</h1>
      <p class="lead-text">Qualifying for the PDC World Darts Championship is the most demanding achievement in professional darts. Every December, 128 competitors from around the globe assemble at London's Alexandra Palace to compete for the Sid Waddell Trophy and a record <strong>£5,000,000 prize fund</strong>, with £1,000,000 awarded to the world champion.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

